<main class="monthly-wrap monthly-admin"><a href="/" class="monthly-back">← Admin Dashboard</a><p class="monthly-kicker">Style Masters Member Hub</p><h1>Monthly content</h1><p class="monthly-intro">Create a month, upload its PDF, and share one link with your members. Add the recording whenever it is ready.</p><div class="monthly-admin-layout"><section class="monthly-panel"><div class="monthly-list-head"><h2>Your months</h2><button class="monthly-button" id="new-month" type="button">New month</button></div><div id="month-list" aria-live="polite">Loading months…</div></section><section class="monthly-panel"><h2 id="editor-title">Create a month</h2><form id="month-form"><label>Month<input type="month" name="month" required min="2000-01" max="2099-12"></label><label>Title <span>(optional)</span><input name="title" maxlength="160" placeholder="For example: Your December Style Guide"></label><label>Welcome message <span>(optional)</span><textarea name="description" rows="3" maxlength="4000" placeholder="A short note to welcome your members."></textarea></label><label>Monthly PDF<input id="month-pdf" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf"></label><p id="pdf-state" class="monthly-help">Choose a PDF up to 10 MB.</p><label>Video recording link <span>(optional)</span><input type="url" name="videoUrl" placeholder="https://…"></label><p class="monthly-help">You can publish with just the PDF and add the recording’s share link later. Make sure members can open it with your video provider’s sharing settings.</p><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="draft">Draft — only you can see it</option><option value="published">Published — ready to share</option></select></label><button class="monthly-button" id="save-month">Save month</button><p id="month-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form><section id="share-month" hidden><h3>Member link</h3><p id="share-help"></p><label class="monthly-sr-only" for="member-link">Permanent member link</label><input id="member-link" readonly><div class="monthly-share-actions"><button class="monthly-button" id="copy-month" type="button">Copy member link</button><a id="open-month" class="monthly-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open member page ↗</a></div><p class="monthly-help">The link stays the same when you update this month. Anyone with the link can view published content. Links do not expire.</p></section></section></div></main><script src="/assets/monthly-content.js" defer></script>
